<title>USA: Investor group raises Glacier Water stake.</title>
<headline>Investor group raises Glacier Water stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Richard Kayne, a Los Angeles brokerage and investment advisory executive, said Monday it raised its stake in Glacier Water Services Inc to 1,215,655 common shares, or 36.6 percent of the total.</p>
<p>In a filing with Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 34,400 shares between Nov 26 and Dec 27 at $20.00 to $22.80 a share.</p>
</text>
